# Wide-match rule: a bare filename here (no leading slash, no path prefix)
# excludes every file with that exact name at ANY depth in the tree - root
# level and nested copies (e.g. per-version folders on production) alike.
# Only add filenames here that should NEVER be published docs content,
# anywhere in the repo, under any name-cased variant.
CLAUDE.md
README.md
readme.md

# Path-scoped rule: a pattern with a path prefix only excludes that exact
# location, not every matching filename repo-wide. The claude/ directory
# holds internal AI-assistant policy files (IA policy, writing-style
# conventions) - never published docs content, but only relevant at root.
claude/
